{
  "job_B23.3.3.4_20261117_183150": {
    "text": "On anre nihte ealdne monan se\u00fee hine adl gestande\u00f0, se bi\u00f0 frecenlice gestanden.\nGif hine on II nihta ealdne monan adl gestande\u00fe, sona he arise\u00fe.\nGif hine on III nihte gestande\u00f0, se li\u00fe f\u00e6ste & smylt.\nGif hine on IIII nihta gestande\u00fe, se bi\u00fe geswenced & \u00feeah arist.\nGif se mona bi\u00fe V nihta eald, \u00feone man m\u00e6g gelacnian.\nGif he bi\u00f0 VI nihta eald & hine adl gestande\u00f0, se bi\u00fe lifes.\nGif he bi\u00f0 VII nihta eald, se swincea\u00f0 lange.\nGif he bi\u00f0 eahta nihta eald, & hine adl gestande, se bi\u00f0 hra\u00fee sweltende.\nGif he bi\u00f0 IX nihta eald, se swincea\u00f0 lange & \u00feeahhw\u00e6\u00f0ere arise\u00fe, & ealswa X & XI.\nGif he bi\u00f0 XII nihta, sona he arise\u00fe.\nGif he bi\u00f0 XIIII nihta eald vel XV vel XVI vel XVII vel XVIII vel XIX, \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 swi\u00fee frecenlic on\nGif he bi\u00f0 XX nihta eald, se li\u00fe lange & arist.\nGif he bi\u00f0 XXI o\u00f0\u00f0e XXII o\u00f0\u00f0e XXIII, se li\u00fe lange & swincea\u00f0 & arist.\nGif he bi\u00f0 XXIIII nihta, se lig\u00f0 f\u00e6ste.\nGif he bi\u00fe on XXV nihta, frecenlice se bi\u00f0 gestanden.\nGif he bi\u00fe gestanden \u00feonne se mona by\u00fe XXVI o\u00f0\u00f0e XXVII o\u00f0\u00f0e XXVIII o\u00f0\u00f0e XXIX nihta eald, se\nGif he bi\u00fe on XXX nihta ealdne monan gestanden, unea\u00f0e he gewyrp\u00f0 & \u00feeah arise\u00fe.",
